    "description": "Custom 2 - Greedy Swarm Starvation: ten drive units share a fleet bay, and a cluster of pods spawns in one isolated storage zone that is reachable only through a capacity-1 gate. A naive allocator sends every unit at the cluster, so up to nine of them jam bumper-to-bumper behind the gate and behind whichever low-ID unit grabbed the pod first. A centralized task allocator should send only as many units as the gate and docks can feed, and park the rest."
